{
    "title": "DataCamp | Data, AI and Coding",
    "description": "Master Computer Education & Programming Skills with DataCamp: \r\n\r\nDevelop your skills by coding in popular programming and scripting languages like Python, SQL, and R. Explore data science concepts and improve your AI skills with DataCamp. Dive into computer science, machine learning and artificial intelligence. Start practising programming today.\r\n\r\nLearn Programming & Data Science: \r\n\r\nJoin 14M learners using DataCamp to enhance their skills in data science, computer science, and AI. With hands-on exercises, learn key programming languages like Python, R, and SQL. Build in-demand skills with the DataCamp app and get ready to tackle real-world challenges through interactive, bite-sized exercises. \r\n\r\nLearn to code & become a better data scientist with the DataCamp app. Build your in-demand data, computer science & AI skills - and accelerate your learning with ChatGPT, Python, SQL, Power BI & so much more! Learn the world\u2019s most in-demand data science and AI skills with DataCamp\u2019s app. Unleash the power of data science with programming languages like Python, and learn how to best utilize AI\u2019s machine learning capabilities. DataCamp\u2019s structured courses guide learners through both foundational and advanced topics in computer science, offering an interactive, hands-on learning experience. Whether you're starting out or looking to deepen your skills, DataCamp\u2019s educational platform equips you to succeed in today\u2019s tech-driven world. Learn best by doing, leveraging computer education & programming concepts to become a better data scientist. \r\n\r\nStart learning how to code with assisted AI and more for free in just 5 minutes a day:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Introduction to ChatGPT: Don\u2019t stay in beginner mode. Explore the power of artificial intelligence through text summarization, drafting high-quality marketing content, generating and explaining code, and more. Start applying your AI skills in the real world today.\r\n\u2022 All Opening Course Chapters are Free: Dive into the language of data with universal free chapters across data science, machine learning, data visualization, data engineering, and cloud computing.\r\n\u2022 Learn Python from Scratch: Begin your data science journey with the world\u2019s most popular programming language with free lessons and in-app coding exercises.\r\n\u2022 Learn SQL: Understand data structures & develop your data analyst skills with our expert-led SQL curriculum. Learn SQL joins, relational databases and data analysis in PostgreSQL\r\n\u2022 R Programming: Discover data science with R; unleash the power of the tidyverse, data visualization, and much more.\r\n\u2022 Learn more efficiently with skill tracks & code-alongs, learning the fundamentals of core concepts within R, SQL and Python. Learn coding & work your way through an entire project from scratch with the help of a screencast so you never get stuck! Then when ready, accelerate your learning on a career track, with certification in R, PowerBI and Python.\r\n\u2022 Cloud Computing: Learn more about cloud computing at a conceptual level, including information about providers like Azure, AWS, and Google Cloud.\r\n\r\nWhether you want to learn programming, become an analyst or learn more about artificial intelligence & Machine Learning - DataCamp has all the information you need to thrive. \r\n\r\nFor those more interested in Data Analysis, and wanting to explore big data concepts, and learn how to visualize data - Check out the DataCamp Desktop for courses on Tableau, Power BI, spreadsheets, statistics, Shell, and Git.\r\n\r\nRead our Privacy Policy and Terms of Service at https://www.datacamp.com/terms-of-use/.\r\n\r\nQuestions? Contact us at https://support.datacamp.com/ \r\n\r\nPractice coding & start your data science journey today!",
